Settings description
__________________________________________________________________

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Settings|
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Settings|

