 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Setting2|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Setting3|
 The ID of the stimulation that will trigger the end of the training
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Setting3|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Setting4|
 The speed of adaptation of the potato field [0 , 1]. The lower the value, the slower the adaptation.
 * |OVP_DocEnd_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Setting4|

 * |OVP_DocBegin_BoxAlgorithm_RiemannianPotatoFieldTrainer_Setting5|
